<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Kolose</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka Kolose</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolose</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">KOLOSE</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda ua kuli vaka Kolose vausonekele kuli kanganda Paulu (1:1) Uasonekele ou mukanda oku tele ali mu kamenga, capuile mu Loma, ku miaka ya makumi atanu na limo (60) hanima yakusemuka ca Yesu. Kolose, hamolika na Efeso na Filimoni, vaitumbula nguavo mikanda ya mu kamenga muomu Paulu uaisonekele oku tele ali mu kamenga. Uasonekelele ou mukanda ku cikungulukilo ca mu nganda ya ku Kolose. Paulu keti ikeye uaputukile cikungulukilo ca mu Kolose, ngue muje muanahandekelamo mu 2:1, vuno honi uacikuatele na mavoko avali. Casiua ngeci Epafalase ikeye uaputukile eci cikungulukilo muomu ikeye uahumine ku Kolose.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulu uashotele mutima ha vilongesa via makuli mu cikungulukilo ku Kolose. Evi vikevio vianasoneka mu vuingi mu mukanda ou. Kuje hamo kuakele civunga ca vaka Kilistu va Vayunda vaje vatondele kusindiya vakuavo vaka Kilistu linga vakavangeye mashiko a Vayunda aku Litavasano Lialaja, cikuma kuma ha via kulovoka. Paulu uasonekele lika ngeci vaka Kilistu nacimo cahi vajena cipue naumo uahi vajena kuvanga lika Kilistu linga vavatambule kuli Njambi 1:15-20 kaha naua ngeci vilongesa vije viakundama ha viyongola via vuntu vinapu viakuhona seho 2:8</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulu aputuka mukanda nakuhinduisa cikungulukilo ca mu Kolose 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ambahoni asoneka ha vukama vua Kilistu cikuma kuma muaku kumbuluilamo ku vilongesa via makuli mu Kolose 1:3—3:4</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ngue kuya mu mikanda yaingi ya Paulu, mbazuvuila yakumanusuila mukanda akaihaka mukuhana vishika vimo viakatumamesi kacili ka vaka Kilistu 3:5—4:6</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Paulu amanusula na vihindu na vishika ngeci mukanda vanapande ku utanda mukutambakana namu vikungulukilo vieka 4:7-18</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Yange Paulu, kanganda ua Kilistu Yesu ku cizango ca Njambi, njili na Timateo muanetu.<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Njili nakutuma ou mukanda kuli yeni vantu va Njambi vakulela na vamuanetu vakulongua muli Kilistu ku Kolose:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Kavumbi kuli yeni na ciyulo vije vihuma kuli Njambi Tatetu.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilombelo lia Citsantsela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Ntsimbu yoshe tukatsantsela Njambi Ishe ya Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, omo nga tumilombelela, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />muomu tunevu lutsilielo lueni muli Kilistu Yesu na cizango cije cimulinaco ku vantu voshe vakulela va Njambi, <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />muomu ya kutsiliela cije civanamitulikila yeni muilu. Cije cimuevuile laja mu lizi lia vusunga, likelio lia Muzimbu Uacili <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />uje uneja kuli yeni, cilivene ha mavu oshe lilinakuima vushuka nakukola ngue muje mulili nakulingilamo kuli yeni vavenia, kuhuma ha litangua limuovuile nakuvuisisa kavumbi ka Njambi mu vusunga. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Ngue muje mumua lilongesele kuli Epafalase ngamba mukuetu uje ituazanga. Ikeye napu ntuama uakulongua ua Kilistu mu kutupangelako, <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />kaha ikeye uje natuleke cizango ceni cije cimuli naco mu Cimbembesi.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Kaha muomu ya cuma eci, hume ha litangua lije tuacuvuile, kutualikelele ku milombelela. Tukalombo Njambi nguetu linga mushule na mana a cizango cendi mu mana nakuvuisisa coshe cije cimbembesi akahana, <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />linga muyoye vuyoye vuje vuatonda Muene, vuje vumuvuahelesa mu vingila vioshe, kuima vushuka mu vipangi vioshe vije viacili na kulivuezelela mu mana a Njambi. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Tukamilombelelako kuli Njambi linga amikolese na nzili yoshe, kuya ku nzili yendi yoshe ya vumpau linga mukale nalukakateya na kusimpa ca nzolela, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />nakuhana kutsantsela kuli Tate uje natupuisa linga tuase kukala na mutambela mukusuana ca vantu vakulela va Njambi mu ceke. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Natuhumisa ku nzili ya milima nakutuneha ku vumuene vua Munendi uje yazanga, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />muje muli ikeye mukemo mutunapatukila, cikeco kukonekela ca vipi.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vuntu vua Kilistu na vipangi viendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kilistu ikeye cifua ca Njambi uje kutuasa kumona, ntuatua ua viakutanga vioshe. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Muomu kuhitila muli ikeye viuma vioshe vavitangele, via muilu nevi viaha mavu, vije vitumona na vije kutumono, cipue matanda, cipue vinzili via vimbembesi, cipue vimiene, cipue vaka nzili yakama. Viuma vioshe vavitangele kuhitila muli ikeye muomu naua ya ikeye. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Ikeye kuakele tele kanda viuma vioshe, kaha muli ikeye viuma vioshe viakala hamo. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Ikeye mutue ua muvila uendi ukeuo cikungulukilo, ikeye maputukilo, ntuatua uakuhuma ku vatsi, linga ikeye akale na cihela cakulivanga mu viuma vioshe. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Muomu camuvuahelesele Njambi linga kushula cendi coshe cikale muli ikeye, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />kaha kuhitila muli ikeye linga anehe viuma vioshe kuli ikeye nakulikonekela, ha mavu cipue muilu, hakulinga ciyulo kuhitila ha maninga aje ahitile ha cilindakano cendi.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Kaha yeni, vaje ha ntsimbu imo muakele kulahako na Njambi nakupua vitozi vendi mu mana eni muomu ya viuma viavipi vije vimualingile. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Vuno honi nalikonekela neni kuhitila mu muvila uendi ua vuntu ha kutsa cendi, linga mupue vakulela vakuhona kapayo nakuhona mulonga kuli ikeye, <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />kaha nga mutualelelaho mu lutsilielo, nakukola na lukakateya, cakuhona kuhuma ku kutsiliela ca Muzimbu Uacili uje muovuile, uje uvanambulula ku cakutanga coshe cije cili muintsi lia melu, kaha na cije yange, Paulu njapuilile ngamba.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vipangi via Paulu hakupua Ngamba ua Cikungulukilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Honi njivuahelela mu tuyando tuange muomu yeni, kaha mu vuntu vuange njimanusula vije vinahonua mu tuyando tua Kilistu muomu ya muvila uendi, uje ukeuo cikungulukilo, <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />cije calingisile ngeci njipue ngamba kuya ku cipangi ca vusunga cije civanjihanene muomu yeni, linga lizi lia Njambi valizivuke muakushula, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />vushueke vuje vuvashueka ha miaka yaingi na ku vikota vioshe vuno honi vanavusholola ku vantu vendi vakulela va Njambi. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Kuli vakevo Njambi uahanguile linga vazivuke muje vati vukama vua vufuko vua vumpau vua vushueke ovu hakati ka vaje keti Vayunda, vuje vukevuo Kilistu uje ali muli yeni, ikeye kutsiliela ca vumpau. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Ikeye uje tuli nakuambulula, kunangula muntu uoshe nakulongesa muntu uoshe mu mana oshe, linga tupuise muntu uoshe kupua uakukola muli Kilistu. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Muomu yeci njilinakupanga cikuma, na kuhundangana na nzili yoshe ije Kilistu akapangesa muli yange.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Muomu njitonda yeni linga muzivuke muje vati njikahundangana cikuma muomu yeni, kaha muomu ya vaje vali ku Laondisiya, kaha na muomu ya voshe vaje kanda vamone cihanga cange, <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />ngeci vasimpise mitima yavo oku vali hamo mu cizango, linga vakale na vufuko vuoshe vua kuvuisisa coshe ca vusunga na mana a vushueke vua Njambi, akeuo Kilistu, <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />uje muli ikeye mukemo vashueka vufuko vuoshe vua mana na mangana. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Njihandeka eci linga naumo uahi amikuise na vihandeka via makuli cipue vene vivuike vati muacili. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Muomu cipue vene njiuahiko mu vuntu, vuno honi njilineni mu cimbembesi, nakuvuahelela mukumona katumamesi keni nakukolesa ca lutsilielo lueni muli Kilistu.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kushula na Muono muli Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Nankuma, ngue muje mu munatambula Kilistu Yesu kupua Muene, ngeci vene tualeleniho kuyoya muli ikeye, <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />mizi yeni itande nakutunga muli ikeye nakukolesa mu lutsilielo, ngue muje vene mu vamilongesele, nakushula mukutsantsela.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Taleni ngeci naumo uahi akamipuise vandungo na mana endi a vuntu na makuli angoco, aje ahuma ku vilongesa via vantu naku vimbembesi via hano ha mavu vije vilinakuyula kaha keti ngue kuya kuli Kilistu. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Muomu mu muvila uendi mukemo muakala kushula coshe ca vunjambi, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />kaha neni munapu vakushula na muono muli ikeye, uje ikeye uapua mutue ua lishiko lioshe na nzili yakama.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Muli ikeye naua mukemo mu mualovokele nakulovoka cije keti ca mavoko, ha kuhumisa muvila ua ntsitu mu kulovoka ca Kilistu, <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />kaha vamitsindile hamo nendi mu kumimbuitika, naua vamisanguile hamo nendi kuhitila mu lutsilielo kuya ku vipangi via Njambi, uje uamusanguile ku vatsi. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Kaha yeni, vaje vatsile mu vipi nakuhona kulovoka ku muvila ua ntsitu yeni, Njambi namineha ku muono hamo nendi, mukutukonekela yetu ku vipi vietu vioshe, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />uahumisile visoneka via mulonga uetu na mashiko avio, kaha eci uacihumisile ha kucishukika ha cilindakano. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Ha cilindakano Kilistu ualipatuile ikeye vavenia kuhuma ku vinzili via vimbembesi vije vilina kuyula na vinzili viakama, ualingile eci mutania muelu ha kuvipuisa cimueso mukupua vinzinda mukuhiana cendi.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Nankuma, keti muecele muntu uoshe amisompe mukumihula ha viakulia na viakunua cipue kuya ku viuano, cipue ku ciuano ca kutentama ca ngonde, cipue via litangua lia Sapalalo. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Evi vikevio lika cimbembe ca viuma vije vili nakuija, vuno honi vusunga vuakundama kuli Kilistu. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Keti muecele muntu uoshe amihonouese, uje alisholola ikeye vavenia kupua uakama na kulemesa tungelo, muomu ha vimona vimo vije ahandeka hakulikehesa ca makuli muomu vantu va cifua cangacije vakalihalesa na viyongola viavo via vuntu, <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />kaha vanalikela kukakatela kuli Kilistu, uje napu mutue ua muvila. Uje kuli ukeuo muvila uoshe vanaulisa naku ukuatesa hamolika kuhitila manunga auo na vusoso, kaha uli nakukola ngue muje muatondelamo Njambi linga ukolemo.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa na kuyoya na Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Nga yeni muatsile na Kilistu ku vimbembesi vije vili nakuyula via hano ha mavu, nkuma vika muli nakuyoya ngue hanga mucili mu vaka mavu? Nkuma vika muli nakulihanena ku mashiko avio aje ahandeka nguauo, <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Keti mukuate eci! Keti mumakele cije! Keti mukuate cije?” <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Evi vioshe vilumbununa viuma vije vikanongo hanima yakuvipangesa, kuya ku mashiko na vilongesa via vuntu. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Evi cilivene visholoka kupua viakukundama ku mana mukusindiya cavo cakulemesa nakulikehesa ca makuli nakuyandesa mivila, vuno honi akeuo kuesi na seho mukuvindika mashungu a ku muvila.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Ambahoni nga vanamisangula hamo na Kilistu, kaha tondeni viuma vije vili muilu, kuje kukeko kuali Kilistu, natumama ku livoko lia cilio lia Njambi. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Hakeleni mana eni ku viuma vije vili muilu, keti ku viuma vije vili ha mavu. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Muomu muatsile, kaha miono yeni vanaishueke na Kilistu muli Njambi. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Omo Kilistu uje ikeye muono uetu akasholoka, ambahoni neni naua mukasholoka nendi mu vumpau.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muono ualaja na mouno uauha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Nankuma, tsiheni vije vinapu via mavu muli yeni, vije vikevio via vupangala, kuhona kulilelesa, mashungu, mashungu a mapi na cipululu, cije cikeco vene kulemesa tumponia. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Muomu ya viuma evi, vutenu vua Njambi vuli nakuija. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Mu viuma evi ha ntsimbu imo muendelemo, omo muakele nakuyoyela muli vikevio.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Vuno honi hano munapande kumbila kuti viuma evi vikevio vije via kuniengua, vutenu, cizindo, kutuka na mezi a mapi kuhuma mu kanua keni. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Keti mulikuise umo na mukuavo, mukumona ngeci munombila vuntu vualaja na vilinga viavuo, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />kaha munazala vuntu vuavuha, vuje vuvanapuisa vua vuha mu mana a cifua ca liavenia Samatanga. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Hano kukuesi Kangelengu cipue Kayunda, mukakulovoka cipue mukakuhona kulovoka, muhuza, cipapoke, ndungo na uakupatuka, vuno honi Kilistu napu ua voshe kaha naua mu vioshe.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Ambahoni, zaleni ngue vantu vakuhangula va Njambi, vakakulela na kuzanga, vacikeketima, na ngozi, na kulikehesa, na kuholoka na kusimpa, <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />kulikonekela umo na mukuavo, kaha nga umo alina ciniengo hali mukuavo, kaha likonekeleni umo na mukuavo, ngue muje Muene nakonekela yeni, neni naua munapande kukonekela. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Kaha helu lia vioshe evi hakeleniho cizango, cije cikakutila viuma vioshe hamolika mu vumo vuacili. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Kaha eceleni ciyulo ca Kilistu ciyule mu mitima yeni, kuje cilivene vamisanene kupua muvila umolika. Kaha pueni vaka kutsantsela. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Eceleni lizi lia Kilistu likale muli yeni cikuma, longeseni nakulinangula umo na mukuavo mu mana oshe, kaha imbeni miaso yakuntsenkulu, na miaso, na miaso ya cimbembesi nakutsantsela mu mitima yeni kuli Njambi. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Kaha vioshe mulinga, mu lizi cipue mu vilinga, vilingeni vioshe mu lizina lia Muene Yesu, nakuhana kutsantsela kuli Njambi Tate kuhitila muli ikeye.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Katumamesi ka muntu mu muono uauha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Vampuevo vakushomboka, lihaneni yeni vavenia ku vamala veni ngue mucinailamo muli Muene.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Vamala vakuambata, zangeni vampuevo veni, kaha keti mupue vakutenuka kuli vakevo.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Vana, ononokeni visemi veni mu vioshe, muomu eci cikeco civuahelesa Muene.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Visemi va vamala keti muputuke vana veni, ketingoconi vapihilila ku mitima yavo.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Vandungo, ononokeni kuli vaje vanapu vimiene veni va ha mavu mu vioshe, keti lika kuvanga kuvali vamimona, ngue vantu vaje vakakutonda lika kuvuahelesa vakuavo vantu, vuno honi cipuevene muli likalieni mu mitima yeni, muomu yakuvuila Muene liova. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Mu vioshe mulinga, pangeni na mutima umo, ngue muli nakupangela Muene keti vantu, <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />okumuazivuka ngueni kuli Muene kukeko mukatambula vusuana kupua ngue vuana vueni, muomu mulina kupangela Muene Kilistu. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Muomu uje muka kupanga via vipi vakamufueta naua via vipi vije vianapanga, kaha kukuesi civembulu.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Vimiene, lingeni muacili na vusunga kuli vandungo veni, muomu neni muazivuka naua ngueni muli na Muene muilu.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vishika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Tualeleniho nalukakateya mu malombelo, kaha taleleleni oku mulombela nakutsantsela kuli Njambi. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Kaha tulombeleleniko netu naua, ngeci Njambi atushokuelele ngila ya lizi linga tuambulule vushueke vua Kilistu, lije muomu ya lizi eli mukemo njili mu kamenga, <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />lombeleni linga njiliambulule muacili ngue muje munjinapande ngeci njilihandeke.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Pueni vakuzangama kuli vije mulinga hakati ka vaje vakakuhona kutsiliela, pangeseni ntsimbu yoshe ije muli nayo. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Eceleni vije vimuhandeka ntsimbu yoshe vipue via kavumbi, viakushutuka ngue muongua linga muzivuke muje vati mukasa kukumbulula muntu uoshe.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vihindu Viamamanusuilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Taikikase akamileka vioshe via cihindu cange, ikeye napu muanetu ua cizango kaha uapua muka kupanga uakulongua na mukuetu ngamba muli Muene. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Njinamutumu kuli yeni muomu yevi vene, linga muzivuke muje vati tulimo kaha naua ngeci akusimpise mitima yeni, <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />kaha alinakuija na Onesimasi, muanetu uakulongua uje uacizango, uje napu umo ueni. Vakumileka vioshe vije vilinakulingiua kuno.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Alisitakase mukuetu uje unjilinendi mu kamenga natumu vihindu kuli yeni, kaha na Mako mpanji ya Mbanambase. (Uje yeni munatambula laja vishika hali ikeye, nga eja kuli yeni, mutambuleni), <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />kaha Yesu uje ivatumbula naua nguavo Yusitase, nendi naua ali nakutuma vihindu. Ava vakevo lika Vayunda hakati ka vakuetu mutukapangela muomu ya Vumuene vua Njambi, kaha vanapu vakevo vaje vanjinasimpila.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafalase, uje napu umo ueni, ngamba ua Kilistu Yesu, natumu vihindu kuli yeni, ntsimbu yoshe akamivuluka mu malombelo endi cakuhona kuhuima, linga mukolese nakushula mu vusunga mu cizango coshe ca Njambi. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Muomu nange njihana vukaleho hali ikeye ngeci napanga cikuma muomu yeni na muomu ya vaje vali mu Laondisiya na mu Halapolise. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Luka cimbanda uje uacizango na Ndemase vanatumu vihindu.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Haneni vihindu viange kuli vamuanetu vaje vali ku Laondisiya, na kuli Nifa na cikungulukilo cije cili mu njivo yendi. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Kaha omo ou mukanda nga vanamanusula kuutanda hakati keni, kaha naua utandeni na mu cikungulukilo ca ku Laondisiya, kaha naua moneni ngeci mutanda uje mukanda uhuma ku Laondisiya. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Kaha handekeni kuli Akipase ngueni, “Tala shulisisa cipangi cije ciunatambula muli Muene.” <verse eid="COL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Yange, Paulu, njilinakusoneka aua mezi a vihindu na livoko liange vavenia. vulukeni malienge ange. Kavumbi kakale neni.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>